## MEAVO release safety

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [RELEASE_POLICY.md](RELEASE_POLICY.md) before release or deployment work. This repository has no staging: feature branches come from `main` and PRs target `main`. The only human gate is merging into `main`, which deploys production; everything before it is agent work and needs no further permission. To release, give the PR, its scope, checks and any production steps in one message; one human yes covers that PR. Ask again only if the PR gains unrelated changes. Never push directly to `main`, bypass protections, or change production outside an approved release. Merge with a merge commit.
